  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1 — Fixes a crash in `teams insights`, `teams trends`, and `boards analysis` when the resource hasn't been generated yet; the CLI now prints a friendly message instead of throwing.\n1.0.0 — First public release. Manage retrospective boards from your terminal, including:\n- `nudgile auth login` — authenticate against nudgile.com\n- `nudgile webhooks list` / `nudgile webhooks add` — manage outbound HMAC-SHA256-signed webhooks\n- `nudgile mcp serve` — local stdio MCP server\n- `nudgile mcp config <client>` — print Claude Code / Claude Desktop / Cursor setup snippet",
